%N A401439 Number of labeled strongly connected digraphs with n arcs.
%H A401439 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A401439/b401439.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..100</a>
%F A401439 a(0) = 1; a(n) = Sum_{k=1..n} T(k,n) for n >= 1, where T is the triangle A057273.
%e A401439 For n = 4, there are 9 strongly connected digraphs with 4 arcs on 3 labeled vertices and 6 on 4 labeled vertices, giving a(4) = 9 + 6 = 15.
